  "hypothesis": "A lightweight supervised objective over lexical-hierarchical IDs can improve the ordering of student-beam miss@10/hit@50 errors when its pairwise sequence-likelihood margin jointly depends on semantic-prefix confusion and training-only target popularity.",
  "score": {
    "definition": "mean teacher-forced log probability over non-padding target tokens including EOS",
